<DocsLayout frontmatter={{ title: "REST API Reference" }}>
  <p>OpenSauce exposes a <a href="https://jsonapi.org">JSON:API</a>-compliant REST API. All endpoints require a Bearer token generated in Settings → API Keys.</p>

  <h2>Spec file</h2>
  <p>Download <a href="/openapi.json"><code>openapi.json</code></a> and load it into any OpenAPI viewer:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://redocly.com/redoc/">Redoc</a> — <code>npx @redocly/cli preview-docs openapi.json</code></li>
    <li><a href="https://editor.swagger.io">Swagger Editor</a> — paste the file</li>
    <li><a href="https://scalar.com">Scalar</a> — drag and drop</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Regenerate</h2>
  <pre>pnpm run generate-spec</pre>
</DocsLayout>
